<section class="ze-hero"><div class="ze-w ze-hero-g"><div class="ze-hero-t"><p class="ze-tag">squeeze &middot; zest &middot; brighten</p><h1>A little citrus makes everything sing.</h1><p class="ze-lead">Zestful is an independent cooking guide to lemons, limes, oranges and their cousins. Learn how to zest without bitterness, get every drop of juice and use acid to rescue a flat dish.</p></div><div class="ze-slice"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 300" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="146" fill="#FFD93D"/><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="128" fill="#FFF3B0"/><g class="ze-spin"><path d="M150 150L270.0 150.0A120 120 0 0 1 247.1 220.5z" fill="#FFE36B" stroke="#FFF3B0" stroke-width="6"/><path d="M150 150L247.1 220.5A120 120 0 0 1 187.1 264.1z" fill="#FFE36B" stroke="#FFF3B0" stroke-width="6"/><path d="M150 150L187.1 264.1A120 120 0 0 1 112.9 264.1z" fill="#FFE36B" stroke="#FFF3B0" stroke-width="6"/><path d="M150 150L112.9 264.1A120 120 0 0 1 52.9 220.5z" fill="#FFE36B" stroke="#FFF3B0" stroke-width="6"/><path d="M150 150L52.9 220.5A120 120 0 0 1 30.0 150.0z" fill="#FFE36B" stroke="#FFF3B0" stroke-width="6"/><path d="M150 150L30.0 150.0A120 120 0 0 1 52.9 79.5z" fill="#FFE36B" stroke="#FFF3B0" stroke-width="6"/><path d="M150 150L52.9 79.5A120 120 0 0 1 112.9 35.9z" fill="#FFE36B" stroke="#FFF3B0" stroke-width="6"/><path d="M150 150L112.9 35.9A120 120 0 0 1 187.1 35.9z" fill="#FFE36B" stroke="#FFF3B0" stroke-width="6"/><path d="M150 150L187.1 35.9A120 120 0 0 1 247.1 79.5z" fill="#FFE36B" stroke="#FFF3B0" stroke-width="6"/><path d="M150 150L247.1 79.5A120 120 0 0 1 270.0 150.0z" fill="#FFE36B" stroke="#FFF3B0" stroke-width="6"/></g><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="14" fill="#FFF8D6"/></svg><figure class="ze-hero-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1794764737544-d4440e6dd65c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=360&h=360&q=75" alt="a pile of fresh oranges with green leaves in warm light" width="360" height="360" fetchpriority="high"></figure></div></div></section>

<section class="ze-s" id="wheel"><div class="ze-w ze-wh"><div class="ze-wh-d"><svg viewBox="0 0 340 340" aria-label="Citrus wheel: choose a variety"><g class="ze-seg" data-v="0" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Lemon"><path d="M170 170L170.0 20.0A150 150 0 0 1 276.1 63.9z" fill="#FFD93D" stroke="#FFFDF2" stroke-width="5"/><text x="208.3" y="77.6" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="13" fill="#1E4D2B" font-weight="700">Lemon</text></g><g class="ze-seg" data-v="1" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Lime"><path d="M170 170L276.1 63.9A150 150 0 0 1 320.0 170.0z" fill="#8BC34A" stroke="#FFFDF2" stroke-width="5"/><text x="262.4" y="131.7" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="13" fill="#1E4D2B" font-weight="700">Lime</text></g><g class="ze-seg" data-v="2" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Orange"><path d="M170 170L320.0 170.0A150 150 0 0 1 276.1 276.1z" fill="#FF8A1F" stroke="#FFFDF2" stroke-width="5"/><text x="262.4" y="208.3" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="13" fill="#1E4D2B" font-weight="700">Orange</text></g><g class="ze-seg" data-v="3" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Grapefruit"><path d="M170 170L276.1 276.1A150 150 0 0 1 170.0 320.0z" fill="#F26B5B" stroke="#FFFDF2" stroke-width="5"/><text x="208.3" y="262.4" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="13" fill="#1E4D2B" font-weight="700">Grapefruit</text></g><g class="ze-seg" data-v="4" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Mandarin"><path d="M170 170L170.0 320.0A150 150 0 0 1 63.9 276.1z" fill="#FFA53D" stroke="#FFFDF2" stroke-width="5"/><text x="131.7" y="262.4" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="13" fill="#1E4D2B" font-weight="700">Mandarin</text></g><g class="ze-seg" data-v="5" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Blood orange"><path d="M170 170L63.9 276.1A150 150 0 0 1 20.0 170.0z" fill="#B22C3A" stroke="#FFFDF2" stroke-width="5"/><text x="77.6" y="208.3" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="13" fill="#fff" font-weight="700">Blood</text></g><g class="ze-seg" data-v="6" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Yuzu"><path d="M170 170L20.0 170.0A150 150 0 0 1 63.9 63.9z" fill="#E8D44D" stroke="#FFFDF2" stroke-width="5"/><text x="77.6" y="131.7" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="13" fill="#1E4D2B" font-weight="700">Yuzu</text></g><g class="ze-seg" data-v="7" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Kumquat"><path d="M170 170L63.9 63.9A150 150 0 0 1 170.0 20.0z" fill="#F7A12B" stroke="#FFFDF2" stroke-width="5"/><text x="131.7" y="77.6" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="13" fill="#1E4D2B" font-weight="700">Kumquat</text></g><circle cx="170" cy="170" r="42" fill="#FFFDF2"/><text x="170" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Lobster Two, cursive" font-size="20" fill="#1E4D2B">tap one</text></svg></div><div><p class="ze-tag">the citrus wheel</p><h2>Meet the family</h2><div class="ze-wh-o" id="wh-o" aria-live="polite"></div></div></div></section>

<section class="ze-s ze-lime" id="yield"><div class="ze-w ze-yd"><div><p class="ze-tag">yield converter</p><h2>How many do I need?</h2><p>Recipes ask for tablespoons; shops sell fruit. Convert between them.</p><div class="ze-yf"><label for="yd-f">Fruit<select id="yd-f"><option value="0">Lemon</option><option value="1">Lime</option><option value="2">Orange</option><option value="3">Grapefruit</option></select></label><label for="yd-w">I need<select id="yd-w"><option value="j">juice</option><option value="z">zest</option></select></label><label for="yd-n">Amount (tbsp)<input id="yd-n" type="number" min="0.5" max="60" step="0.5" value="4"></label></div></div><div class="ze-yo" id="yd-o" aria-live="polite"></div></div></section>

<section class="ze-s"><div class="ze-w"><div class="ze-fix-h"><p class="ze-tag">the rescue squad</p><h2>What does your dish need?</h2><p class="ze-lead">Taste, then tap what is wrong. Citrus fixes more than you think.</p></div><div class="ze-fix" role="group" aria-label="Problem with the dish"><button type="button" data-f="0">Too salty</button><button type="button" data-f="1">Too sweet</button><button type="button" data-f="2">Too rich or heavy</button><button type="button" data-f="3">Too spicy</button><button type="button" data-f="4">Flat or dull</button><button type="button" data-f="5">Fishy</button></div><div class="ze-fix-o" id="fx-o" aria-live="polite"><p>Pick a problem above.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="ze-s ze-cream"><div class="ze-w"><p class="ze-tag">tool drawer</p><h2>Four ways to take the zest</h2><div class="ze-tools"><div><span class="ze-ic">&#9636;</span><h3>Fine grater</h3><p>Fluffy, fine zest that melts into batters, dressings and sauces.</p><em>Best all-rounder</em></div><div><span class="ze-ic">&#8776;</span><h3>Channel zester</h3><p>Long thin strands for garnish and candied peel.</p><em>For looks</em></div><div><span class="ze-ic">&#9644;</span><h3>Vegetable peeler</h3><p>Wide strips to infuse milk, syrups and stews, then lift out.</p><em>For infusing</em></div><div><span class="ze-ic">&#9650;</span><h3>Small knife</h3><p>Slice peeled strips into fine julienne when you have no tools.</p><em>In a pinch</em></div></div><div class="ze-circ"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1682530016902-7a97ae2038f3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&h=300&q=75" alt="a person holding half a lemon" width="300" height="300" loading="lazy"></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571115637329-40ce3401d0f3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&h=300&q=75" alt="a grey citrus juicer" width="300" height="300" loading="lazy"></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1730984226506-7459e3887291?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&h=300&q=75" alt="lemons and vegetables beside a cutting board" width="300" height="300" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div></section>

<section class="ze-s"><div class="ze-w"><p class="ze-tag">when it&rsquo;s best</p><h2>Citrus through the year</h2><p class="ze-small">Peak seasons in the northern hemisphere. Southern hemisphere imports fill many of the gaps.</p><div class="ze-gantt"><div class="ze-gm"><span></span><i>J</i><i>F</i><i>M</i><i>A</i><i>M</i><i>J</i><i>J</i><i>A</i><i>S</i><i>O</i><i>N</i><i>D</i></div><div class="ze-gr"><span>Lemons</span><div class="ze-gb"><b style="left:0.000%;width:100.000%;background:#FFD93D"></b></div></div><div class="ze-gr"><span>Limes</span><div class="ze-gb"><b style="left:33.333%;width:50.000%;background:#8BC34A"></b></div></div><div class="ze-gr"><span>Navel oranges</span><div class="ze-gb"><b style="left:0.000%;width:33.333%;background:#FF8A1F"></b><b style="left:83.333%;width:16.667%;background:#FF8A1F"></b></div></div><div class="ze-gr"><span>Grapefruit</span><div class="ze-gb"><b style="left:0.000%;width:41.667%;background:#F26B5B"></b><b style="left:83.333%;width:16.667%;background:#F26B5B"></b></div></div><div class="ze-gr"><span>Mandarins</span><div class="ze-gb"><b style="left:0.000%;width:25.000%;background:#FFA53D"></b><b style="left:75.000%;width:25.000%;background:#FFA53D"></b></div></div><div class="ze-gr"><span>Blood oranges</span><div class="ze-gb"><b style="left:0.000%;width:33.333%;background:#B22C3A"></b><b style="left:91.667%;width:8.333%;background:#B22C3A"></b></div></div><div class="ze-gr"><span>Yuzu</span><div class="ze-gb"><b style="left:75.000%;width:25.000%;background:#E8D44D"></b></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="ze-grove"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1794878530079-71c0c021eb38?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&h=640&q=75" alt="a citrus tree laden with ripe orange fruit and dark green leaves" width="1600" height="640" loading="lazy"></figure><blockquote>&ldquo;Add salt and you taste the food. Add acid and you taste it brighter.&rdquo;<cite>A kitchen rule of thumb</cite></blockquote></section>

